Audio soft clipper (src/audio/asoftclip.ts)

src/audio/asoftclip.ts adapts the ASC_HARD and ASC_ALG loops of filter_flt and
filter_dbl, the option table and the FILTER_SAMPLEFMTS list (fltp, dblp) of
FFmpeg libavfilter/af_asoftclip.c.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
